<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Infinity Core Alternative Fund Application</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Subscription Booklet is utilized for
the private offering of shares of beneficial interest (the &ldquo;Shares&rdquo;) in the Infinity Core Alternative Fund (the &ldquo;Fund&rdquo;).
This Subscription Booklet may be used only by investors that are &ldquo;accredited investors&rdquo; within the meaning given to
such term in Regulation D under the U.S. Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the &ldquo;Securities Act&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>All Applications must be received FIVE
BUSINESS DAYS before the end of the month for a subscription to be accepted.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>ALL WIRED AMOUNTS must be received THREE
BUSINESS days before the end of the month for a subscription to be accepted and effective as of the beginning of the month immediately
following such receipt.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>ALL PURCHASE CHECKS must be received
TEN BUSINESS days before the end of the month for a subscription to be accepted and effective as of the beginning of the month
immediately following such receipt. In order to purchase, all checks must clear prior to month end.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

